  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep veggies: Bring a medium saucepan of water to the boil for the corn. Crush or finely chop 2 garlic cloves. Cut the capsicums into 5mm chunks. Discard the husk and silks from the corn, then halve widthwise. Thinly slice the spring onion, keeping the white and green parts separate. Drain and rinse the beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/302046/photos/large/prep_veggies-f912e1e28690ca21cd17a6ca50fff33a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Simmer chilli: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium deep frypan over medium-high heat. Add the garlic, half the capsicum and 2 tsp Mexican spice blend and cook for 1 min. Add the tomatoes, beans, 2 tsp tomato paste and ½ tsp sugar and bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium and cook for 6-8 mins until slightly reduced. Season with salt and pepper, then remove from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/302047/photos/large/simmer_chilli-86600931964c3990d38695557abc7697.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boil corn: Meanwhile, cook the corn in the pan of boiling water for 8 mins or until tender. Drain, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/302048/photos/large/boil_corn-66c6fff675e8f785c046412d227eff8d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make salsa: Put 2 tsp olive oil and 1 tsp white vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the white part of the spring onion and remaining capsicum and toss to combine. Cut the avocado into 1cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/302049/photos/large/make_salsa-eee287d5f79ff9ba21294c1d9c8a2743.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the chilli among bowls, then top with the corn, avocado, capsicum salsa and remaining spring onion. Scatter the remaining Mexican spice blend, if desired, over the corn and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/302050/photos/large/serve_up-0db87839dababfca3a41ba566cc98613.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Add a little crunch with some corn chips or baked tortillas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/302051/photos/large/make_it_yours-0cfdb435b887e22ecf3a0a240f9dd5aa.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
